# Harness working files, under .claude/ with the harness itself.
# Findings and session logs ARE tracked: docs/target-state/README.md cites them,
# and .claude/work/active-work.md is the live project state everyone reads first.
# Only transient and duplicated material is ignored.
.claude/outputs/.verify-cache/
.claude/outputs/target-state/

